@title Live potentials card: a card taller than the window scrolls instead of being cut off at 1366x768
@area Live
# QA round 1350 coverage: the Live card of the reversing, crane and conveyor lessons ran past the
# bottom edge with no way to reach its last controls. Here the example's card on the control circuit
# page is shown in a window only 520 high, so it is taller than the pane.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key shift+l
wait 40
shot live-card
click_text "Go to page 2 Control circuit"
wait 30
shot live-card-control
# A low window makes the card taller than the pane: its last controls must still be reachable.
resize 1366 520
wait 20
shot live-card-low-window
check_layout
# The wheel over the card moves it: the last controls come into view.
scroll 130 300 -400
wait 20
shot live-card-scrolled
